<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<odoo><data>
<template id="s_mk_services" name="MK Services">
    <section id="services" class="mk-services" data-snippet="s_mk_services" data-name="MK 服務介紹">
        <div class="container position-relative">
            <h2 class="mk-sec-title">服務</h2>
            <div class="mk-sec-line"/>
            <div class="mk-why-title">Why Mark Studio?</div>

            <div class="mk-svc">
                <div class="mk-svc-left">
                    <div class="mk-svc-num">01</div>
                    <div class="mk-svc-heading">
                        <span class="mk-svc-hl">運用獨創技術，</span><br/>
                        <span class="mk-svc-hl">帶給您前所未有的感受</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="mk-svc-text">馬克健身使用獨創的核心平衡伸展術，針對僵硬的深層肌群進行放鬆和伸展。致力於從根源上解決您的煩惱，減少復發頻率。</p>
                </div>
                <div class="mk-svc-right">
                    <div class="mk-svc-img"><img src="/markstudio_website/static/src/img/svc-01-massage.jpg?v=3" alt="深層按摩服務" loading="lazy"/></div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="mk-svc">
                <div class="mk-svc-left">
                    <div class="mk-svc-num">02</div>
                    <div class="mk-svc-heading"><span class="mk-svc-hl">全身放鬆，享受伸展</span></div>
                    <p class="mk-svc-text">在進行伸展的過程中，您所需做的僅僅只是放鬆您的身心。而放鬆狀態下的肌肉更容易被伸展。</p>
                </div>
                <div class="mk-svc-right">
                    <div class="mk-svc-img"><img src="/markstudio_website/static/src/img/svc-02-stretch.jpg?v=3" alt="專業伸展服務" loading="lazy"/></div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="mk-svc">
                <div class="mk-svc-left">
                    <div class="mk-svc-num">03</div>
                    <div class="mk-svc-heading"><span class="mk-svc-hl">一對一專業伸展</span></div>
                    <p class="mk-svc-text">教練會依據顧客的不適症狀，對身體不同部位的柔軟性進行判斷，從而提供最適合您的伸展方案。教練也會根據顧客的身體情況提出相關建議，幫助您養成良好伸展習慣，為您身體的健康出謀劃策。</p>
                </div>
                <div class="mk-svc-right">
                    <div class="mk-svc-img"><img src="/markstudio_website/static/src/img/svc-03-personal.jpg?v=3" alt="一對一專業伸展" loading="lazy"/></div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</template>
</data></odoo>
